WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.530
Hi! I'm Momo. Let's practice Say that again?.

2
00:00:05.930 --> 00:00:07.269
catch

3
00:00:07.669 --> 00:00:08.979
mean

4
00:00:09.379 --> 00:00:11.328
a little more slowly

5
00:00:11.728 --> 00:00:14.633
Sorry, I didn't catch that.

6
00:00:15.033 --> 00:00:17.612
Could you speak a little more slowly?

7
00:00:18.012 --> 00:00:20.147
What do you mean by that?

8
00:00:20.547 --> 00:00:23.056
Do you mean the meeting is tomorrow?

9
00:00:23.456 --> 00:00:25.511
Thanks for explaining.

10
00:00:25.911 --> 00:00:28.420
We're moving the meeting to tomorrow.

11
00:00:28.820 --> 00:00:31.725
Sorry, I didn't catch that.

12
00:00:32.124 --> 00:00:35.249
The meeting will be tomorrow, not today.

13
00:00:35.649 --> 00:00:38.974
Got it. Thanks for explaining.

14
00:00:39.374 --> 00:00:44.138
Remember this expression. Could you speak a little more slowly?

15
00:00:44.538 --> 00:00:51.253
Great job! Pause, repeat, and make it your own. See you in the next lesson!
